# Future content collections go here.
# When you're ready to add a blog:
#   1. Create src/content/config.ts and define your collection
#   2. Add .md/.mdx files in src/content/blog/
#   3. Create src/pages/blog/index.astro and src/pages/blog/[slug].astro
# See: https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/content-collections/
